# fixedbugs, defect 2321, 2026-11-07: the shape padded, another field
# between the two declarations of `value`. The construction naming each
# name once was told it missed `value:, unit:, value:`; read against each
# name's first declaration it gives every field in order, and is told
# nothing more.
record Reading
    value: i64
    unit: str
    value: i64  #~ field_declared_twice

function main()
    r = Reading(value: 1, unit: "mm")
    print(r.unit)
